Indra Fine-tuning

This project derives from Indra OCR by Datalab:
https://github.com/datalab-to/indra
Upstream base: 3d773aeedc5d79d1d0a2a04007a9075cd71a59f4 (version 0.3.2).
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is preserved in LICENSE.

Local additions and changes, October 2026:
- Reconstructed, trainable PyTorch line recognizer and ONNX parity checks.
- CTC fine-tuning, vocabulary extension, checkpoint resume, and ONNX export.
- Fine-tuning documentation, validation report, integration tests, and CI.
- Package metadata, README, and ignore rules updated for this distribution.
- The upstream PyPI publishing workflow has been removed.

The original upstream README is retained in UPSTREAM_README.md.
Model weights are downloaded separately from datalab-to/indra-ocr on
Hugging Face and have their own license; no weights are included here.
